OL,3,GNEWSAPopular free walks festival
OL,4,Areturns for 20th year
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuildford's annual Walkfest will return
OL,7,Fin September for its 20th year,
OL,8,Foffering a programme of free guided
OL,9,Fwalks across the borough.
OL,11,FThe month-long festival features at
OL,12,Fleast one walk every day and is
OL,13,Forganised by local groups including the
OL,14,FSurrey Hills Society, Guildford
OL,15,FRamblers, Guildford Health Walks and
OL,16,FGuildford Town Guides.
OL,18,FWalks range from town tours to
OL,19,Fcountryside routes, with some led by
OL,20,Fspecialists covering topics such as
OL,21,Flocal history and the Wey & Arun Canal.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
